  - biometric
abstract: |
  HHG is a privacy-respecting, end-to-end pipeline that takes a face
  image, performs multi-engine reverse-image search to discover the
  identity's public web/social presence, and anchors the discovered
  evidence on an EVM blockchain for tamper-evident auditing.
